<section id="security-deposit-guide" class="wrap detail-section deposit-guide">
  <div class="deposit-guide__intro">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Direct answer</p>
      <h2>What is security deposit automation?</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="deposit-guide__definition">
      Security deposit automation is a controlled move-out workflow that gathers the deposit ledger, inspections,
      before-and-after evidence, invoices, policy context, deadlines, approvals, disposition documents, delivery,
      refund status, and PMS writeback in one versioned case. It automates coordination and recordkeeping. It does not
      give AI authority to decide liability, normal wear, legal compliance, deductions, or refunds.
    </p>
  </div>

